      "patchedSha256": "e1e45a1efd4fc1f9b6ba5ea3d61ce9554d53f062004b699f4f3272d48b7996cf",
      "reason": "Match the uint8_t mouse_byte_index definition. Original full-width extern read/write accessed adjacent globals; browser relative menu input lost movement before this correction.",
      "verification": "Original mismatched extern lost browser cursor movement. Matching uint8_t extern restores accurate menu hover. Same real80ms Play tap then exposed original ACK race: disable-reporting command read queued release header08 and returned. Bounded ACK reading reaches active wave1, movement and firing, with Game running status and no JS errors."
    },
    {
      "file": "proj/src/controllers/kbc/mouse.c",
      "originalSha256": "b6e86ef90c2b5204a47704c82e10893e1a50f35cd5f7c7e50465a37c2de08067",
      "patchedSha256": "3b4b473060479b523a3fa2a5ff6b6ef2aa76f5e8048ac9da77ae2cd2a0a83a60",
      "reason": "Wait for the mouse command ACK behind queued stream bytes. The same 80ms mobile Play tap previously read release header0x08 as the disable-reporting response and returned before gameplay; bounded ACK loop makes menu-to-keyboard transition work.",
      "verification": "Original mismatched extern lost browser cursor movement. Matching uint8_t extern restores accurate menu hover. Same real80ms Play tap then exposed original ACK race: disable-reporting command read queued release header08 and returned. Bounded ACK reading reaches active wave1, movement and firing, with Game running status and no JS errors."
    }
